# Game car 2, first sheet. PDF page 9, block A.
# Written like a MAME netlist: chips by location, then each wire as the pins it joins.
# tools/generate_netlist.py names the Verilog wires from the pins: docs/NET_NAMES.md.
chip L10 7408
chip L9 7432
chip K9 7420
chip J9 74193
chip K11 7404
chip N10 74151
# Fixed 2026-11-05: M10.7 (ENP) follows the 5ART3/5CRT3 wire; pin 10 alone is ARTG/CRTG. Death Race 7C/7N agree.
chip M10 74161
chip K10 7400
chip G16 7402
chip H12 7404
prom J10 82S123 34
# Pin 4 follows K11.8 (5ACT2), not the pre-inverter ACT2 wire.
chip J11 74174
chip K8 7486
chip K12 74161
chip J12 74161

# Wires: drawing label, then every pin it joins on this sheet. BOARD marks a
# wire that rtl/deathrac_board.v drives or reads. GND/VCC are tied pins, OPEN a
# visibly floating input, NC a drawn output stub that goes nowhere.
net ATWD L10.6 L9.5
net 5ART3 L10.4 M10.7 K11.2 G16.2 K10.13 K10.4
net 1BGUT L10.5 K10.5
net ATWE L9.6 K9.4 K9.10
net ATWF L9.4 N10.5
net 5APRS L10.8 J9.11
net 5ECDG L10.9
net 5LWTB L10.10
net 6AQLT K9.6 J9.4
net BLFT K9.1
net ARTG K9.2 K9.12 M10.10 L10.3
net 1LQ07 K9.5 K9.9 K10.10
net 6AQRT K9.8 J9.5
net 5BLFT K9.13
net GND J9.14 J9.15 J9.1 J9.10 N10.1 N10.3 N10.4 M10.3 M10.4 M10.5 M10.6 J10.14 J10.15
net A999 J9.9 N10.2 M10.1 J11.1 K12.1 K12.5 K12.6 K12.10 J12.1 J12.5 J12.6 J12.10 BOARD
net ACT0 J9.3 N10.13 N10.15 J10.10
net ACT1 J9.2 N10.14 J10.11
net ACT2 J9.6 K11.9 J10.12
net ACT3 J9.7 J10.13 J11.3
net NC J9.13 J9.12 N10.6 M10.15 K12.11 K12.12 K12.13 K12.14 J12.11 J12.12 J12.13 J12.14
net 5ACT2 K11.8 J11.4
net ART3 N10.7 M10.11 K11.1
net ART2 N10.9 M10.12
net ART1 N10.10 M10.13
net ART0 N10.11 M10.14
net OPEN N10.12
net 6TQLC M10.2 K12.2
net 5ARTL M10.9 K10.3
net BGGT K10.1
net TLGX K10.2
net TLC0 L10.1
net TLGZ L10.2
net 2AQTN G16.1
net 6TQGX G16.3
net K10_11 K10.11 H12.11
net 2TQGX K10.12
net 2AQT0 H12.10
net AKC0 J10.1
net AKC1 J10.2
net AKC2 J10.3
net AKC3 J10.4
net ALL0 J10.5 J11.14
net ALL1 J10.6 J11.13
net AEL0 J10.7 J11.11
net AEL1 J10.9 J11.6
net 6AQUT J11.9 K10.8
net 1ACT3 J11.2 K8.2
net 6ACT2 J11.5 K8.1
net 1AEL1 J11.7 J12.4
net 1AEL0 J11.10 J12.3
net 1ALL1 J11.12 K12.4
net 1ALL0 J11.15 K12.3
net AGT2 K8.3
net AEUT K10.6 K10.9
net 5ALCC K12.7 K11.6
net 5TFGY K12.9 J12.9
net ALCC K12.15 K11.5
net 6TQ07 J12.2
net 5AECC J12.7 K11.10
net AECC J12.15 K11.11
